  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: with an Activity current on the calling thread when a manual trigger is made, the handler observes no inherited parent (Activity.Current is null, or a new root whose ParentId is not the request's) while it runs.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: the caller's Activity.Current is the same object after the trigger call returns; the trigger response, run id and the run store record are unchanged; the scheduled path's behaviour and tests are unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, filtered tests (Scheduling, ScheduledJob, AdminJobs) and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="false">(Not testable here) Main session triggers signal-reevaluation on dev after the next uac-r2 dev BFF build and confirms the run's logs reach App Insights.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>The fix needs a sampler or OpenTelemetry configuration change, a new package, or changes the trigger API: STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>
