  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3140 squash-merged to master (75fff0d9bb, Closes #3125) after a main-session review. TriggerNowAsync clears Activity.Current only around the Task.Run that starts the manual run and restores it in finally (ExternalAccessAudit device), so the run's logs carry no trace context and are not dropped with an unsampled trigger request; sampler, OpenTelemetry setup, trigger API, run store and the scheduled path unchanged; no Activity added. Handler-sees-no-inherited-Activity test fails on master; Scheduling 85/85, ArchTests 2816/2816; publish +36 B. Known limit: the one 'Manual admin trigger dispatched' line is written inside the request. Dev check after the next uac-r2 dev BFF build: a manual signal-reevaluation run's lines reach App Insights. Dev check PASS 2026-11-25 18:16Z on BFF a1b7db1def: manual run 0ff49695 (owner-approved) Succeeded; its SignalWriter (125), SignalReevaluationJob (2) and ScheduledJobHost (9) traces reached App Insights.</completion>
</task>
